// ============================================================
// SMARTMIST ESP32-S3  -  2-ZONE COMPARISON VERSION (v8)
//
//   ZONE 1 = MISTED   : DHT22 (GPIO 6)  + misting pump
//   ZONE 2 = CONTROL  : DHT22 (GPIO 11) only, for comparison
//
// - Zone 1 heat index >= 42 -> pump starts; <= 39 -> pump stops
// - Pump pulses 15 s ON / 5 s OFF while misting
// - Float switch: tank empty -> pump will NOT start (checked every 1 s);
//   if it empties while running, the pump stops after a short debounce
// - Peltiers (x2) + fans (x2) switch together, only when tank water
//   is warm (>= 30 C, stop at 28 C). Same thresholds whether the pump is
//   running or not (see COOL_DURING_MIST).
// - On mist START and STOP both DHT22s are read together and stored in
//   /logs/m_<epochSec> (before, after, duration, comparison)
// - Logs are buffered, uploaded when WiFi returns
// - AUTO / MANUAL mode (MANUAL uses /controls/zone1Command)
// - 3 WiFi networks with automatic failover
// - v8: WiFi, time and Firebase start in the background. Outputs and
//   AUTO control run immediately at power-up, with or without WiFi.
//
// 4-CH RELAY (5 A, active LOW): K1 -> PUMP, K2 -> BOTH fans (in parallel)
//                               (K3-K4 unused)
// 30 A RELAYS (2 x 1-channel): Relay A -> Peltier 1, Relay B -> Peltier 2
// ============================================================


